# 🆕 Round 28b36 (founder 2026-05-04, perf #64) — Vercel deploy size fix.
#
# Background: `public/` was 333 MB because `public/images/icon/` had
# 80+ unused animated GIFs (Rocket.gif 24 MB, Cupid 15 MB, Premium 13 MB
# etc). Only 4 files in that folder are referenced by source code:
#
#   images/icon/User.gif
#   images/icon/admin.png
#   images/icon/star.png
#   images/icon/sunred-logo.png
#
# Everything else in `images/icon/` is mockup junk that bloated every
# Vercel deploy. This ignore file shrinks the upload to <100 MB so
# deploys complete inside Vercel's free-tier window.
#
# .vercelignore uses gitignore-style globs.

# Editor / OS junk
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store

# Server-side function code (deployed via firebase, not vercel)
functions/

# One-shot scripts (not part of the SPA) — exclude the directory contents
# but KEEP the build-time prerender step (Round 28s106). Note: we must use
# `scripts/*` (not `scripts/`) so the negation below can re-include a single
# file — gitignore can't un-ignore a child if the whole parent dir is excluded.
scripts/*
!scripts/prerender-routes.mjs

# Local-only env templates
.env.local
.env.development.local

# Source maps from production builds (Vercel re-builds anyway)
**/*.js.map
**/*.css.map

# Big animated mockup icons that aren't referenced in src/.
# Whitelist the 4 files we DO use via the negation rules below.
public/images/icon/*.gif
!public/images/icon/User.gif

# 🆕 Round 28s279 (founder: "Vercel ฟรีจำกัดจำนวนไฟล์อัปโหลด ลบไฟล์เก่าที่
#   ไม่ได้ใช้ได้ไหม") — content/docs/marketing files are NOT build inputs
#   (Vite only needs index.html + src/ + public/ + config + the prerender
#   script). Excluding them from the Vercel upload cuts the per-deploy file
#   count so we hit the free-tier `api-upload-free` limit far slower.
#   Nothing here is deleted from the repo — it just never uploads to Vercel.
docs/
Brand/
SEO_Blog_Pack/
Expansion/
.github/
.claude/

# Markdown + one-off planning/handoff notes (co-founder memory + strategy).
# None are read at build or runtime.
*.md
DEPLOYMENT_STATUS.md
HANDOFF.md
ROADMAP.md
